      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NANGAR MYSTERY (7) scored his maiden success two back then hit the frame last time when second and beaten 0.8 lengths at Grafton over 450m (25.48). Will break from a wide draw. In form and looks a top chance again. PURPOSE (6) made a big impression on debut when well supported and ran up to expectations, showing a strong turn of foot to score a 5.5 lengths win at Maitland over 450m in 25.11. Harder here but expected to measure up if runs up to debut effort. INGLEWOOD STAR (1) had been racing well prior to his last start seventh at this track following a Maiden win three back with a third placing. Well placed here and should do much better. CANYA FAKE IT (2) cannot be written off despite a miss here at her latest outing.",
